{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775910/extras/image.png?t=1749016029\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>The Last Squad Demo</strong> \u2013 a sneak peek into the core experience of our class-based co-op zombie shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>6 unique heroes across 3 classes</strong>: Tank, DPS, and Healer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through <strong>1 playable stage</strong>: <i>Ruined City</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up in <strong>4-player co-op mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy <strong>approximately 1 hour of gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note:<br>This is a preview version, and some features of the full game are not included in the demo. The following content is <strong>currently under development</strong> and will be available in the full release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hero Traits and Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Named Zombies (5 types)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Zombies (3 types)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional Stages (3 more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We look forward to your feedback as we continue developing <i>The Last Squad</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775910?t=1749016029","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775910?t=1749016029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775910/d48481c6c90cae6fd961e6659203510ec8903a00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749016029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c